      "content": "SP 90 SE                          ASHLEY GREEN            WHELPLEY HILL 2/15                                                           Barn to South-East of                                                           Spencer's Farmhouse GV                                                           II C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 4 bays, now adapted as living accommodation.  Old tile roof.  Wagon entry on bay 2 now glazed screen.  Brick outside stair to doorway in bay 4.  Later additions at rear are of no historic interest. Listing NGR: SP9954304710"
    }
